# Placeholder — replace with the real team CA certificate (PEM).
#
# The team CA private key is held OFFLINE (air-gapped machine or hardware
# token) and never enters a networked host or this repo. Generate the CA
# offline, commit only the certificate here, and keep the key on the offline
# medium:
#
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout team-ca.key -out team-ca.crt \
#     -days 3650 -nodes -subj "/CN=team-ca/O=team"
#
# Steps: 1) commit this file; 2) install it as the MariaDB server `ssl-ca`
# (see doc/system/team-db-users.md); 3) keep team-ca.key offline — it is the
# only thing that signs member certificates.
